# A Game of Thrones LCG Card Search

agot-lcg-search is a fan project by Asier Elorz. This project is not affiliated with Fantasy Flight Games or any other organization or publisher in any manner. Portions of this page are unofficial Fan Content permitted under the Fantasy Flight Games IP Policy. The literal and graphical information presented on this site about _A Game of Thrones: The Card Game_, including card images and symbols, is copyright Asmodee North America, Inc. This page is not produced by or endorsed by Fantasy Flight Games.

This is a hobby project and thus one of its pillars is to keep it at budget zero. This guides some of the technical decisions behind the implementation and explains the lack of certain features. At the current moment I do not plan to either spend or make money from this project. This page is a gift given for free to the internet and to the players of the game, to preserve its memory and aid at deckbuilding.

## Support

If you find a bug or any other way in which the page could be improved, please open an issue on our [GitHub](https://github.com/asielorz/agot-lcg-search).

## Special thanks

- The [Internet Archive](https://archive.org/). Most of the pages about the game, even the official FFG pages, have been taken down, now that the game has been more than a decade out of print. Big chunks of the information this page contains would have been impossible to gather without the Internet Archive's Wayback Machine.
- Reddit user [X_a_n_s_h_i_82](https://www.reddit.com/user/X_a_n_s_h_i_82/) and the [Proxy Nexus](https://proxynexus.net/) project, for sharing high quality card scans.
- [Card Game Collector](https://www.cardgamecollector.com/game-of-thrones-lcg-1ed/index.html), who preserved and shared many original documents.
